---
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_TAGLINE } from '../consts';
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-stone-900 text-stone-300 pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-stone-800">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-stone-800">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Manifesto -->
      <div class="md:col-span-6 space-y-3">
        <span class="text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-stone-50">
          {SITE_TITLE}<span class="text-emerald-500">.</span>
        </span>
        <p class="text-stone-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          {SITE_TAGLINE}. Ruang bacaan mandiri untuk memahami dinamika karir, merawat kesehatan mental, dan mengurai kecemasan hidup di usia awal dewasa.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 pt-1">
          Disusun dengan pendekatan editorial berbasis fakta dan pengalaman nyata.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Topik Liputan -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-200">
          Fokus Topik
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-400">
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Mindset & Refleksi</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Produktivitas & Atensi</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Kesehatan Mental</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Karir & Navigasi Kerja</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Finansial Realistis</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Arsip & Info -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-200">
          Publikasi
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-400">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Halaman Depan</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Indeks Seluruh Artikel</a></li>
          <li><a href="#habit-log" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Refleksi Harian (Vue)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-stone-200 transition-colors">Tentang Redaksi</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between text-xs text-stone-500 gap-3">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} {SITE_TITLE}. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi undang-undang.</p>
      <p class="text-stone-400">
        Membaca dengan sadar, melangkah dengan tenang.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
